---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Website privacy — Bastco"
  description="Information about this website’s optional Cal.com calendar, third-party links, and handling of sensitive assessment information."
>
  <div class="site-container">
    <article class="prose-page">
      <p class="eyebrow">Website privacy</p><h1>
        A simpler website.<br />Fewer connections.
      </h1>
      <p>
        This notice describes the public Bastco website. It does not describe
        every data flow in Kifaru or replace the terms agreed for a consulting
        engagement.
      </p>
      <h2>Browsing the site</h2><p>
        The pages and fonts are served as static website assets. This website’s
        application code does not add advertising trackers, an analytics
        service, or a contact-form database. The hosting and network
        infrastructure may process request information such as IP addresses and
        browser metadata to serve and protect the site.
      </p>
      <h2>Optional scheduling with Cal.com</h2><p>
        The calendar is not embedded until you select “Load scheduling
        calendar.” Activating it connects your browser to Cal.com, whose service
        may process network information, cookies, and booking details under its
        own policies. You can instead follow the direct scheduling link.
      </p><p>
        Review <a
          href="https://cal.com/privacy"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer">Cal.com’s privacy policy</a
        > before submitting a booking. Please share only what is needed to arrange
        the conversation.
      </p>
      <h2>Keep sensitive information out of bookings</h2><p>
        Do not submit passwords, API keys, personal records, confidential target
        details, or vulnerability evidence through the calendar. Agree on a
        suitable private channel with Bastco first.
      </p>
      <h2>Links to other services</h2><p>
        GitHub, Kifaru’s installation site, and other linked resources are
        separate destinations. Following a link takes you to that service and
        its policies. Third-party links are not automatically loaded as embedded
        content.
      </p>
      <h2>Kifaru is a separate product workflow</h2><p>
        Running Kifaru can involve local transcripts, evidence, and requests to
        your selected model provider. Review its documentation and your provider
        configuration before an assessment. The public website’s privacy
        behavior does not establish a data-containment guarantee for the agent.
      </p>
      <h2>Questions</h2><p>
        <a href="/#contact">Arrange a conversation with Bastco</a> for questions about
        this site or the handling requirements for a prospective engagement. Do not
        include sensitive details in the booking.
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>
</Layout>
